6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, plus the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover! I want to see how things actually work on the floor.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will review the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests. I want to understand the long-term financial trajectory.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and the upgrade history of the dispatch tool! I want to make sure we have a clear plan when things go wrong.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the data lift in the 2018 pay move and the warehouse rule changes after new accounts. I suspect there are lingering ghosts in our legacy migrations that deserve a closer look.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
